                                                "text": "A Lucullan feast"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a672a36-d0c2-4e05-b15c-8969bef185cb",
                                                "sense_id": "da1f08b5-1d32-38d7-8112-8547a4fe8db9",
                                                "text": "\"He will deign to finish this simple fare and wash it down with nothing more Lucullan than beer.\""
                                            }
